title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/metarecord-list:folder
catalog: GUI command
target: metarecord-list:folder
summary: List the selected metarecord's folder in the metarecord list (here / other / new)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shipped ``commands.js``

!! Default keys

* ``b g f`` → ``metarecord-list:folder new``
* ``g f`` → ``metarecord-list:folder here``
* ``i g f`` → ``metarecord-list:folder here``
* ``w g f`` → ``metarecord-list:folder other``
